sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant SDK as codeflare-sdk
    participant Auth as kube-authkit
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant Ray as Ray Dashboard<br/>HTTP/HTTPS TLS configurable
    participant Kueue as Kueue CRDs

    Note over User,Kueue: Flow 1: Client Authentication
    User->>SDK: Initialize SDK client
    SDK->>Auth: Auto-detect credentials
    alt kubeconfig available
        Auth-->>SDK: kubeconfig credentials
    else in-cluster
        Auth-->>SDK: Service account token
    else Bearer token
        Auth-->>SDK: Bearer token
    end
    SDK->>K8sAPI: Authenticate (TLS)<br/>CA cert via CF_SDK_CA_CERT_PATH<br/>or /etc/pki/tls/custom-certs/ca-bundle.crt

    Note over User,Kueue: Flow 2: TLS Certificate Provisioning
    User->>SDK: Generate cluster certs
    SDK->>SDK: generate_cert.py<br/>RSA-3072 / SHA-256<br/>Self-signed CA + server cert
    SDK->>K8sAPI: Create Secret<br/>(TLS cert + key)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: Secret created

    Note over User,Kueue: Flow 3: Workload Submission (via KubeRay)
    User->>SDK: Define Ray cluster config
    SDK->>K8sAPI: Create RayCluster CR<br/>(CustomObjects API)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: RayCluster created
    SDK->>K8sAPI: Create RayJob CR<br/>(CustomObjects API)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: RayJob created

    Note over User,Kueue: Flow 4: Direct Job Submission (via Ray Dashboard)
    User->>SDK: Submit job directly
    SDK->>Ray: POST job submission<br/>Headers + Cookies<br/>TLS verify configurable
    Ray-->>SDK: Job ID + status

    Note over User,Kueue: Flow 5: Queue Integration
    User->>SDK: Check queue status
    SDK->>K8sAPI: List LocalQueues<br/>(CustomObjects API)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: LocalQueue list
    SDK->>K8sAPI: List ClusterQueues<br/>(CustomObjects API)
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: ClusterQueue list
    SDK-->>User: Queue status + capacity
